  "notes": "Names use 2016 competition forms reconciled with the raw anchor: Kara Webb (later Kara Saunders), Anna Tunnicliffe (listed in the current archive as Anna Tobias), Katrin Davidsdottir and Sara Sigmundsdottir (Icelandic). Cole Sager's Event 2 (deadlift ladder) shows scoreDisplay '465 lb' but the lift was ruled invalid, so he placed 40th for 0 points. Events 11-13 (Sunday morning) are half-value (50-point) tests.",
